00:02:38.991 --> 00:02:41.060
-"Just lay down there, honey.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.830
Honey, just lay down on the rug
just so I can get the..."

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.266
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:47.867
"Honey, just lay down on the rug

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:49.235
