00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:08.587
-[ Laughs ]
-"Don't move."

00:03:08.587 --> 00:03:09.889
-I gotta see it again.

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:12.025
I just think
that's so funny, man.

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:13.392
